(6430530, 954785, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is a bold and great entry, for some reason I am drawn to abstracts and near abstracts a bit more that the standard "wow factor" shots. I like the green and circular patterns; nice shot.</td>', 'This is a bold and great entry, for some reason I am drawn to abstracts and near abstracts a bit more that the standard "wow factor" shots. I like the green and circular patterns; nice shot.', '2011-06-01 09:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6430535, 954454, 12611, '<td valign="top">Very epic feel here. I love how the mist creates a medieval feel. Super tree placement; near perfect, close to a winner, I predict low top 10.</td>', 'Very epic feel here. I love how the mist creates a medieval feel. Super tree placement; near perfect, close to a winner, I predict low top 10.', '2011-06-01 09:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6430536, 954484, 12611, '<td valign="top">Good feel here- works with the two kids, subtle and seemless placement and execution, good choice of Black and white- not enough people use it in full sunlight and water shots.</td>', 'Good feel here- works with the two kids, subtle and seemless placement and execution, good choice of Black and white- not enough people use it in full sunlight and water shots.', '2011-06-01 09:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6430543, 953788, 12611, '<td valign="top">I want to like this shot a great deal, I mean I like it but I want to like It more- maybe its the painter in me wanting to improve on the scene, the colors, the values, the composition. I think the strong points are the misty fog, the light on the water, the blue colors in the dark side of the shot to the right, the hopeful feel of the sky. Unfortunately this is lost in the crop of the photo, the digital feel of the sky, and the awkward unbalance of the values left to right. <br/> <br/>Sorry for the criticism, just trying to be constructive.</td>', 'I want to like this shot a great deal, I mean I like it but I want to like It more- maybe its the painter in me wanting to improve on the scene, the colors, the values, the composition. I think the strong points are the misty fog, the light on the water, the blue colors in the dark side of the shot to the right, the hopeful feel of the sky. Unfortunately this is lost in the crop of the photo, the digital feel of the sky, and the awkward unbalance of the values left to right.  Sorry for the criticism, just trying to be constructive.', '2011-06-01 09:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6430544, 954682, 124346, '<td valign="top">It''s a really really relaxed pose, did you jump for it or is it a trick?  You got me thinking jejejeje.</td>', 'It''s a really really relaxed pose, did you jump for it or is it a trick?  You got me thinking jejejeje.', '2011-06-01 09:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6430547, 954326, 12611, '<td valign="top">Super shot, if it was not for those trailers in the back... it just obscures your subject too much and makes it too busy. Nice clarity in the boots and great focus in all the right spots.</td>', 'Super shot, if it was not for those trailers in the back... it just obscures your subject too much and makes it too busy. Nice clarity in the boots and great focus in all the right spots.', '2011-06-01 10:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6430549, 953950, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great action, great title; alternate title "this just can''t end well..." I think its about a 7-8. Its not your fault, its just that the background screws up the composition, in a perfect world, a bit to the left. no trees behind and filling up less frame you''d have a ten- but you still have a hell of a shot in my book.</td>', 'Great action, great title; alternate title "this just can''t end well..." I think its about a 7-8. Its not your fault, its just that the background screws up the composition, in a perfect world, a bit to the left. no trees behind and filling up less frame you''d have a ten- but you still have a hell of a shot in my book.', '2011-06-01 10:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
