(6432059, 954682, 132996, '<td valign="top">Amazing. I love how he just looks like he happens to be standing in mid-air. :D Could have used a better backdrop though. :\</td>', 'Amazing. I love how he just looks like he happens to be standing in mid-air. :D Could have used a better backdrop though. :\', '2011-06-02 18:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
