(6432074, 954705, 132996, '<td valign="top">I love this. It''s amazing how you can see her strength! The lighting is wonderful and black &amp; white was the right choice. :)</td>', 'I love this. It''s amazing how you can see her strength! The lighting is wonderful and black & white was the right choice. :)', '2011-06-02 18:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
