(6432238, 953739, 86447, '<td valign="top">"Capture objects in the air." is the challenge description...  I don''t consider humans as objects... soo... Not sure how to vote this so will be back later.</td>', '"Capture objects in the air." is the challenge description...  I don''t consider humans as objects... soo... Not sure how to vote this so will be back later.', '2011-06-02 22:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432239, 954577, 86447, '<td valign="top">Could be sharper... but I love the composition and colors. 7</td>', 'Could be sharper... but I love the composition and colors. 7', '2011-06-02 22:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432241, 953289, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of this... I wish it were sharper, though.  6</td>', 'I love the idea of this... I wish it were sharper, though.  6', '2011-06-02 22:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432250, 954427, 86447, '<td valign="top">Ha!   Well done!    7<br/> <br/>(but... on my monitor, there are bunches of light spots on the right third.   To see how it will look on most monitors, I take my finished edit and slide the sliders on Levels)</td>', 'Ha!   Well done!    7 (but... on my monitor, there are bunches of light spots on the right third.   To see how it will look on most monitors, I take my finished edit and slide the sliders on Levels)', '2011-06-02 22:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432253, 953920, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love the light on totally black background, but wish the subject were a bit clearer.   5</td>', 'I love the light on totally black background, but wish the subject were a bit clearer.   5', '2011-06-02 22:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432340, 953766, 86447, '<td valign="top">Too much noise for my high vote, but I love the sharpness!  6</td>', 'Too much noise for my high vote, but I love the sharpness!  6', '2011-06-02 23:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432343, 954260, 86447, '<td valign="top">Looking at the image I don''t see anything that meets the challenge description, "Capture objects in the air. Use a fast shutter speed to capture objects off-the-ground in an unusual way. Through your camera, photograph the world in suspended animation unlike you normally would."<br/> <br/>Although I am totally in love with this little girl... and the shadows on the bridge... the convincing title does not make it seem to meet the challenge.  I''m sorry.    It would be a wonderful entry as a Free Study... but not for Objects in Air/high speed stuff.   *sigh* 4</td>', 'Looking at the image I don''t see anything that meets the challenge description, "Capture objects in the air. Use a fast shutter speed to capture objects off-the-ground in an unusual way. Through your camera, photograph the world in suspended animation unlike you normally would." Although I am totally in love with this little girl... and the shadows on the bridge... the convincing title does not make it seem to meet the challenge.  I''m sorry.    It would be a wonderful entry as a Free Study... but not for Objects in Air/high speed stuff.   *sigh* 4', '2011-06-02 23:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432432, 954237, 102315, '<td valign="top">Best of the bunch</td>', 'Best of the bunch', '2011-06-03 00:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432433, 953732, 102315, '<td valign="top">Is this tornado destruction? Beautiful yet so tragic! Powerful image and I hope everyone else catches the lighter than air part of this image.</td>', 'Is this tornado destruction? Beautiful yet so tragic! Powerful image and I hope everyone else catches the lighter than air part of this image.', '2011-06-03 00:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
