(6432855, 954484, 28742, '<td valign="top">This feels like a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=54645" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bspurgeon</a>. If not, consider it high praise. :)</td>', 'This feels like a  bspurgeon. If not, consider it high praise. :)', '2011-06-03 05:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432856, 954441, 28742, '<td valign="top">LOL! How many tries did it take to capture this?? Terrific image and very I love the humor.</td>', 'LOL! How many tries did it take to capture this?? Terrific image and very I love the humor.', '2011-06-03 05:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432860, 953365, 28742, '<td valign="top">i can''t wait to find out what the heck that thing is! :)</td>', 'i can''t wait to find out what the heck that thing is! :)', '2011-06-03 05:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432862, 954237, 101668, '<td valign="top">I read the challenge as Lighter than Air and defined it to myself that the wind should be able to blow the subject away. Chlge further states the world in suspension. And this makes it very difficult for me to vote. The dog is definetly not lighter than air but it is suspended. So it does match and it doesn''t. Therefore I''ll vote on the quality of the picture only.</td>', 'I read the challenge as Lighter than Air and defined it to myself that the wind should be able to blow the subject away. Chlge further states the world in suspension. And this makes it very difficult for me to vote. The dog is definetly not lighter than air but it is suspended. So it does match and it doesn''t. Therefore I''ll vote on the quality of the picture only.', '2011-06-03 05:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432864, 953732, 28742, '<td valign="top">Holy sh*t! Great title. Joplin, MO?</td>', 'Holy sh*t! Great title. Joplin, MO?', '2011-06-03 05:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432880, 954221, 101668, '<td valign="top">Might be controversial but the balloons are tied to the head. Although they are suspended you probably did not use a fast shutterspeed. For that reason it DNMC but true to myself I''d rather not vote</td>', 'Might be controversial but the balloons are tied to the head. Although they are suspended you probably did not use a fast shutterspeed. For that reason it DNMC but true to myself I''d rather not vote', '2011-06-03 06:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
