(6433845, 954221, 131284, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a great image but the softness/focus spoils it for me, it looks like it was perhaps cropped from the side of a super wide angle? Perhaps though it''s a limitation of the camera used. Whatever the case the framing is still good, as was your eye when taking this shot.</td>', 'I think it''s a great image but the softness/focus spoils it for me, it looks like it was perhaps cropped from the side of a super wide angle? Perhaps though it''s a limitation of the camera used. Whatever the case the framing is still good, as was your eye when taking this shot.', '2011-06-04 11:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433855, 953920, 131284, '<td valign="top">I''m confused why there''s a small white border on 3 sides of the image, each being a different thickness, almost as though it''s an image of an image... but I guess there''s a more reasonable explanation, presumably with how this image was post processed. Anyway, I don''t know if that noise is an effect of post processing, but looks a lot like the image was just massively cropped in - but either way with the black and white I think it really works here, I like it - just those white borders annoy me =).</td>', 'I''m confused why there''s a small white border on 3 sides of the image, each being a different thickness, almost as though it''s an image of an image... but I guess there''s a more reasonable explanation, presumably with how this image was post processed. Anyway, I don''t know if that noise is an effect of post processing, but looks a lot like the image was just massively cropped in - but either way with the black and white I think it really works here, I like it - just those white borders annoy me =).', '2011-06-04 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
