(6436208, 954237, 115229, '<td valign="top">The litle black thing in the left corner does no good ...beside that it''s funny and creative photo!</td>', 'The litle black thing in the left corner does no good ...beside that it''s funny and creative photo!', '2011-06-06 20:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436398, 954441, 60862, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the laugh! :)</td>', 'Thanks for the laugh! :)', '2011-06-07 00:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436402, 954785, 60862, '<td valign="top">Lovely abstract and just enough definition.  Nice title, too.</td>', 'Lovely abstract and just enough definition.  Nice title, too.', '2011-06-07 00:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436405, 953806, 60862, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad this is so small; I have a feeling that at a larger size, the shapes would be fun to explore.</td>', 'It''s too bad this is so small; I have a feeling that at a larger size, the shapes would be fun to explore.', '2011-06-07 00:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436407, 954781, 60862, '<td valign="top">Ooh, I bet that made a mess when it hit the side of the bin.</td>', 'Ooh, I bet that made a mess when it hit the side of the bin.', '2011-06-07 00:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436421, 954484, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  Evokes all kinds of memories of joy at the beach.  Especially with the sun low in the sky, meaning the day is almost done, so it''s time for one more bit of splashing. 10!</td>', 'Wonderful!  Evokes all kinds of memories of joy at the beach.  Especially with the sun low in the sky, meaning the day is almost done, so it''s time for one more bit of splashing. 10!', '2011-06-07 00:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436422, 954806, 60862, '<td valign="top">Glorious point of view! I can feel the swish of the air as she goes past, and at the same time, imagine the feel of being with her and enjoying that moment of weightlessness at the peak on each swing.  Very strong composition, too. 10.</td>', 'Glorious point of view! I can feel the swish of the air as she goes past, and at the same time, imagine the feel of being with her and enjoying that moment of weightlessness at the peak on each swing.  Very strong composition, too. 10.', '2011-06-07 00:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436427, 954326, 113142, '<td valign="top">a more shallow DOF would have really helped here</td>', 'a more shallow DOF would have really helped here', '2011-06-07 00:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436431, 954041, 113142, '<td valign="top">This is so soft and dreamy! Beautiful</td>', 'This is so soft and dreamy! Beautiful', '2011-06-07 00:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436432, 954785, 113142, '<td valign="top">Sometimes technical perfection does not convey the feeling, this is nice.</td>', 'Sometimes technical perfection does not convey the feeling, this is nice.', '2011-06-07 00:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436433, 953820, 113142, '<td valign="top">Points for humor!</td>', 'Points for humor!', '2011-06-07 00:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436439, 954484, 113142, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you strayed from the "fast shutter" direction, the motion blur says more than a static, sharp shot would. This is beautiful! 9</td>', 'I''m glad you strayed from the "fast shutter" direction, the motion blur says more than a static, sharp shot would. This is beautiful! 9', '2011-06-07 01:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436440, 954806, 113142, '<td valign="top">I love the angle! I got kicked in the face once while straying behind a swing, never again</td>', 'I love the angle! I got kicked in the face once while straying behind a swing, never again', '2011-06-07 01:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436442, 953936, 113142, '<td valign="top">I love the perfect shadows. They look like icons for some evil arch nemesis!</td>', 'I love the perfect shadows. They look like icons for some evil arch nemesis!', '2011-06-07 01:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436445, 954610, 113142, '<td valign="top">Lighter than air? I feel depressed.</td>', 'Lighter than air? I feel depressed.', '2011-06-07 01:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436446, 954682, 113142, '<td valign="top">Very surreal, I hope you posted a description in your comment section!</td>', 'Very surreal, I hope you posted a description in your comment section!', '2011-06-07 01:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436449, 954005, 113142, '<td valign="top">you made dream a reality. awesome.</td>', 'you made dream a reality. awesome.', '2011-06-07 01:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436452, 954508, 113142, '<td valign="top">If only: entire background was same color (the shadows are great!) and you had cropped out the glass.</td>', 'If only: entire background was same color (the shadows are great!) and you had cropped out the glass.', '2011-06-07 01:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436453, 954260, 113142, '<td valign="top">Lighter than air?</td>', 'Lighter than air?', '2011-06-07 01:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436454, 954695, 113142, '<td valign="top">tricky timing!</td>', 'tricky timing!', '2011-06-07 01:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436458, 953758, 88520, '<td valign="top">I liked the idea of this one, and the marbles are perfectly frozen, but I think a different background would have helped them stand out more.  I think the shadows add an interesting effect, but I wish I could see more of the profile shadow.</td>', 'I liked the idea of this one, and the marbles are perfectly frozen, but I think a different background would have helped them stand out more.  I think the shadows add an interesting effect, but I wish I could see more of the profile shadow.', '2011-06-07 01:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436462, 954326, 88520, '<td valign="top">So much going on in the background.  A lower angle might help de-clutter.</td>', 'So much going on in the background.  A lower angle might help de-clutter.', '2011-06-07 01:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436463, 954747, 88520, '<td valign="top">This one is so fun and has a lot of energy! I can just imagine the setup :)</td>', 'This one is so fun and has a lot of energy! I can just imagine the setup :)', '2011-06-07 01:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436466, 954485, 88520, '<td valign="top">I love the variety in the shapes and the different way each person jumped.  A couple of spots on the left side were a bit distracting, though.</td>', 'I love the variety in the shapes and the different way each person jumped.  A couple of spots on the left side were a bit distracting, though.', '2011-06-07 01:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436468, 954765, 88520, '<td valign="top">I love this one!</td>', 'I love this one!', '2011-06-07 01:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436470, 954549, 88520, '<td valign="top">Wish I could see the whole feather as it''s softly falling.  The way it''s positioned makes it feel like it''s being held, rather than floating.  I like the tones in this one.</td>', 'Wish I could see the whole feather as it''s softly falling.  The way it''s positioned makes it feel like it''s being held, rather than floating.  I like the tones in this one.', '2011-06-07 01:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
