(6437970, 954778, 3444, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Looks like Utah Lake and Timpy in the background.  Maybe a couple holes from Talons Cove as well.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Looks like Utah Lake and Timpy in the background.  Maybe a couple holes from Talons Cove as well.', '2011-06-08 03:05:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6437996, 954010, 86218, '<td valign="top">Hey - Congrats on your first entry finish. You did very well and wish you well with future entries. Nice take and some valid comments for improvements on the pic. Nothing wrong with the creativity and thats what''s often most important on DPC</td>', 'Hey - Congrats on your first entry finish. You did very well and wish you well with future entries. Nice take and some valid comments for improvements on the pic. Nothing wrong with the creativity and thats what''s often most important on DPC', '2011-06-08 03:28:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438013, 954485, 28742, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Ankur! This is fantastic!</td>', 'Congrats, Ankur! This is fantastic!', '2011-06-08 03:58:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438014, 954705, 28742, '<td valign="top">Congrats! One of my top picks!</td>', 'Congrats! One of my top picks!', '2011-06-08 03:58:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438037, 954005, 69368, '<td valign="top">Christian, ich finde, du hast hier eine sehr schöne Komposition aus Farben gestaltet. Die orangefarbenen Kugeln vor dem blauen Hintergrund machen sich ziemnlich gut. Auch die Bildgestaltung als solche (zwei-drittel-Regel) finde ich gut umgesetzt. Und ich mag die Idee.<br/>Nicht so schön ist es, dass das "Spielgerät" noch zu sehen ist. Dadurch verliert das Bild ein klein wenig an Effekt. (musste Claudia sich ins Gras hocken und dir assistieren?)<br/> <br/>Und, hey!, Platz 25! Das ist schon ziemlich gut!</td>', 'Christian, ich finde, du hast hier eine sehr schöne Komposition aus Farben gestaltet. Die orangefarbenen Kugeln vor dem blauen Hintergrund machen sich ziemnlich gut. Auch die Bildgestaltung als solche (zwei-drittel-Regel) finde ich gut umgesetzt. Und ich mag die Idee.Nicht so schön ist es, dass das "Spielgerät" noch zu sehen ist. Dadurch verliert das Bild ein klein wenig an Effekt. (musste Claudia sich ins Gras hocken und dir assistieren?) Und, hey!, Platz 25! Das ist schon ziemlich gut!', '2011-06-08 05:05:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438045, 954005, 131264, '<td valign="top">@james_so It`s from the Popn&amp;Catch Ballgame which throws the ball in the air. I thought this creates a connection to the balls</td>', '@james_so It`s from the Popn&Catch Ballgame which throws the ball in the air. I thought this creates a connection to the balls', '2011-06-08 05:33:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438060, 954041, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is excellent!</td>', 'This is excellent!', '2011-06-08 06:18:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438069, 954023, 132251, '<td valign="top">Well this was my first ever submission. I feel very good that I got a 5.828! While looking at the breakdown I can''t believe I received a couple 1''s and 2''s... On the other hand I can''t believe I got some 9''s and 10''s though :-)<br/> <br/>I didn''t want all of the bees in focus. I wanted only the one incoming one in focus, so your eyes would be drawn to her as she was the point of the picture. <br/> <br/>I am just getting back into photography after a 19 year hiatus from an old Minolta x-7. I am glad I found this website.</td>', 'Well this was my first ever submission. I feel very good that I got a 5.828! While looking at the breakdown I can''t believe I received a couple 1''s and 2''s... On the other hand I can''t believe I got some 9''s and 10''s though :-) I didn''t want all of the bees in focus. I wanted only the one incoming one in focus, so your eyes would be drawn to her as she was the point of the picture.  I am just getting back into photography after a 19 year hiatus from an old Minolta x-7. I am glad I found this website.', '2011-06-08 06:38:59.000000', NULL, 0),
