(6438401, 954695, 131284, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the constructive and positive comments! james_so pretty much hit the nail on the head and for that reason I don''t mind the score at all. Hopefully next time I can find the time to shoot FOR a challenge, instead of the other way around =).<br/> <br/>And chinajoe: If you wish to make a criticism, please do it in a constructive way (which I will happily take on board). As it stands I fail to see how my image; showing a stone in the air, fails to meet the criteria when your image; showing popcorn in the air, does. the only difference is the closer crop on yours which can be argued makes your image meet the challenge <u>better</u>, but both images ultimately represent a similar occurrence and so must both meet criteria or neither, no? My guess is however, that you spent more time copy/pasting the rules in to my image than actually looking at the image, and so failed to see the stone.</td>', 'Thanks for all the constructive and positive comments! james_so pretty much hit the nail on the head and for that reason I don''t mind the score at all. Hopefully next time I can find the time to shoot FOR a challenge, instead of the other way around =). And chinajoe: If you wish to make a criticism, please do it in a constructive way (which I will happily take on board). As it stands I fail to see how my image; showing a stone in the air, fails to meet the criteria when your image; showing popcorn in the air, does. the only difference is the closer crop on yours which can be argued makes your image meet the challenge better, but both images ultimately represent a similar occurrence and so must both meet criteria or neither, no? My guess is however, that you spent more time copy/pasting the rules in to my image than actually looking at the image, and so failed to see the stone.', '2011-06-08 12:00:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438409, 954485, 58715, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by curtpetguy:</b></div><hr/><i> Ankur, congrats on your first ribbon, fun shot </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Curt.</td>', 'Originally posted by curtpetguy: Ankur, congrats on your first ribbon, fun shot   Thanks Curt.', '2011-06-08 12:02:51.000000', NULL, 0),
