(6441017, 954806, 88520, '<td valign="top">I''ve been using DPC as a teaching and learning tool in my classroom on a daily basis for the past four years--discussing photos, following tutorials, and generally getting inspired.  (I guess that makes it especially ridiculous that I''ve only managed to enter four challenges...)  Anyway, thank you all for the positive feedback :)  I''m honored.</td>', 'I''ve been using DPC as a teaching and learning tool in my classroom on a daily basis for the past four years--discussing photos, following tutorials, and generally getting inspired.  (I guess that makes it especially ridiculous that I''ve only managed to enter four challenges...)  Anyway, thank you all for the positive feedback :)  I''m honored.', '2011-06-11 00:36:57.000000', NULL, 0),
