(6443331, 954101, 133370, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the feedback everyone.  I have a new respect for anyone who captures action photos.  I had the perfect spot, good framing, good opportunity but no warning.  The goose dropped in unannounced.  No time to get proper focus. 4 bad frames later he had already landed. I need a lot more practice.<br/></td>', 'Thanks for the feedback everyone.  I have a new respect for anyone who captures action photos.  I had the perfect spot, good framing, good opportunity but no warning.  The goose dropped in unannounced.  No time to get proper focus. 4 bad frames later he had already landed. I need a lot more practice.', '2011-06-13 22:28:47.000000', NULL, 0),
